# Bard the Bowman: "Reach" and "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. It gains
# lifelink until end of turn." On turn 3 Bot1 draws for the turn (the first card), then casts Ancestral Recall and draws three more:
# the second card triggers the ability once - the third and fourth do not - and Bot1 puts the counter on Bard, who has lifelink for
# the turn and, attacking as a 2/4, gains Bot1 2 life; on turn 4 the lifelink is gone and the counter stays. A Mox Pearl is no
# creature, so it is not a legal target (Bot2's Ornithopter is the other creature there is to choose).

